 **Parameters:**
 *   **Filters:** Catmul-Rom, B-spline, ambient occlusion projection, trilinear, bilateral, gradient, and filtered gradient [S1].
-*   **Cache Size:** Determined by the ray bundle width and the filter kernel support [S1].
